{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "KJV1769",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 59,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Deliver me from mine enemies, O my God: defend me from them that rise up against me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Deliver me from the workers of iniquity, and save me from bloody men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For, lo, they lie in wait for my soul: the mighty are gathered against me; not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my transgression, nor ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my sin, O LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They run and prepare themselves without ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fault: awake to help me, and behold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou therefore, O LORD God of hosts, the God of Israel, awake to visit all the heathen: be not merciful to any wicked transgressors. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They return at evening: they make a noise like a dog, and go round about the city.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, they belch out with their mouth: swords ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in their lips: for who, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "say they",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", doth hear?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But thou, O LORD, shalt laugh at them; thou shalt have all the heathen in derision.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his strength will I wait upon thee: for God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my defence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The God of my mercy shall prevent me: God shall let me see ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my desire",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon mine enemies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Slay them not, lest my people forget: scatter them by thy power; and bring them down, O Lord our shield.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the sin of their mouth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the words of their lips let them even be taken in their pride: and for cursing and lying ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they speak.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Consume ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in wrath, consume ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", that they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "may",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be:",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " and let them know that God ruleth in Jacob unto the ends of the earth. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And at evening let them return; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " let them make a noise like a dog, and go round about the city.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let them wander up and down for meat, and grudge if they be not satisfied.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I will sing of thy power; yea, I will sing aloud of thy mercy in the morning: for thou hast been my defence and refuge in the day of my trouble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.59.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.59.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Unto thee, O my strength, will I sing: for God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my defence, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the God of my mercy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
